{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f08897d764a8ab1e","name":"Scurrg H-6 Prototype Bomber","source":{"id":"source:reference-f08897d764a8ab1e","title":"Scurrg H-6 Prototype Bomber","revision":20043,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:05:23Z","sha256":"39648c14a52c4e8ac0477bb1be46164f1faa8f7a32b98012d7da4a2d5d13a34c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20043","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Scurrg%20H-6%20Prototype%20Bomber&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f08897d764a8ab1e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Scurrg H-6 is one of the most dangerous ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," designs in the galaxy. It is created five years before the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," by the Nubian Design Collective, who hope to sell it to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},", seeing little use for an expensive offensive bomber, refuses the Collective's offer. The original Scurrg prototype is mothballed on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nubia"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nubia?action=edit&redlink=1"}," while the Collective lackadaisically seeks another buyer. As they search, the prototype is stolen by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feeorin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feeorin","referenceId":"reference:00b3e70f2d041f58"}," pirate named ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nym"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nym","referenceId":"reference:cb76da4fb487eca2"}," with the aid of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jinkins"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jinkins?action=edit&redlink=1"},", one of the Collective's engineers.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Following the original prototype's theft, the Nubian Design Collective produces several other prototypes anticipating the impending civil war. These new prototypes incorporate minor improvements on the original design, but are otherwise identical. The expense of the Scurrg H-6, along with its advanced Nubian technology, dissuades a number of buyers (including the Republic) from investing in the Scurrg. Given their friendly relationship with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},", the Nubians refuse to entertain offers from the Confederacy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Scurrg is best classified as a heavy assault starfighter. It is equipped with six forward-mounted ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"},", a Laser Turret, and an experimental ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Bomblet Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Bomblet_Generator","referenceId":"reference:9a95812248523aff"},". The energy spheres dropped by the Scurrg are produced by the Bomblet Generator, which uses the ship's primary power source to create them. The generator can produce one Bomblet every 10 rounds (1 minute), but it can hold no more than ten energy spheres at any one time. The Scurrg can easily be equipped with a standard Bomb Chute that drops standard Proton Bombs.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The original Scurrg prototype, as flown by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nym"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nym","referenceId":"reference:cb76da4fb487eca2"},", is known as ",{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Havoc"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Havoc?action=edit&redlink=1"},". In addition to an improved ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"}," engine, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Havoc"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Havoc?action=edit&redlink=1"}," is modified to allow Nym to operate it without a full crew complement. While ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nym"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nym","referenceId":"reference:cb76da4fb487eca2"}," takes the helm, the gunner and navigator positions are filled by two Astromech Droids, which have been integrated into the ship's system.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Scurrg H-6 Prototype Bomber Statistics (CL 10)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -1; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 15 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 12), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 27; +12 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 140; ",{"tag":"a","ch